OL,6,     FThe Taskmaster returns with his
OL,7,     Fbearded golden retriever Alex
OL,8,     FHorne and a fresh litter of
OL,9,     Fpuppy-eyed comics: Chloe Petts,
OL,10,     FIsy Suttie, Matt Lucas, Nina Conti
OL,11,     Fand Richard Ayoade.
OL,12,G0325 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FClaire, who's 22, is rushed to
OL,14,     FQueen's after she collapsed while
OL,15,     Fshe was out running. Emma has
OL,16,     Fserious leg burns after spilling a
OL,17,     Fkettle. Adele is struggling with
OL,18,     Fan injured toe.
